                "Graph is not connected; no spanning tree exists. Use computeForest for a minimum spanning forest.");
        }
        // Zero components only for an empty graph; otherwise exactly one tree.
        return forest.components().isEmpty() ? new MstResult(List.of(), 0L) : forest.components().get(0);
    }

