     * {@link #computeForest(GraphBuilder)}) assembles and validates the {@link Graph}.
     *
     * <p>Implement this to load a graph from any origin — a file, a database, a network
     * service, or one generated on the fly — without depending on a particular text format
     * or on {@code Graph}'s internals. {@link EdgeListGraphBuilder} is the built-in
     * implementation for the edge-list text format.
     */
    public interface GraphBuilder {

        /** The number of vertices in the graph; vertices are indexed {@code 0..count-1}. */
        int vertexCount();

        /** Feeds every undirected edge of the graph to {@code sink} exactly once. */
        void provideEdges(EdgeSink sink);

        /** Receives an undirected edge with a positive weight. */
        @FunctionalInterface
        interface EdgeSink {
            void accept(int from, int to, int weight);
        }
    }

    /**
